msgctxt "help:aeat.347.report,contact_name:"
msgid ""
"The full name must appear in a correct order: First surname, blank space, "
"Second surname, blank space, Name"
msgstr "全名必须按正确顺序填写：第一姓氏、空格、第二姓氏、空格、名字"

msgctxt "help:aeat.347.report,on_behalf_third_party_limit:"
msgid ""
"The declaration will include parties from which we received payments, on "
"behalf of third parties, over this limit"
msgstr "申报将包含代第三方收取款项超过此限额的往来单位"

msgctxt "help:aeat.347.report,operation_limit:"
msgid ""
"The declaration will include parties with the total of operations over this "
"limit"
msgstr "申报将包含交易总额超过此限额的往来单位"

msgctxt "help:aeat.347.report,received_cash_limit:"
msgid "The declaration will show the total of cash operations over this limit"
msgstr "申报将显示超过此限额的现金交易总额"

msgctxt "help:aeat.347.report,representative_vat:"
msgid "Legal Representative VAT number."
msgstr "法定代表人增值税号。"

msgctxt "help:aeat.347.report.party,business_premises_rent:"
msgid ""
"Set to identify premises rent operations aside from the rest. You'll need to"
" fill in the premises info only when you are the one that receives the "
"money."
msgstr "设置后，将营业场所租赁交易与其他交易区分。仅当您是收款方时才需填写场所信息。"

msgctxt "help:aeat.347.report.party,cash_vat_criteria:"
msgid "Annual amount of transactions accrued under cash VAT criteria."
msgstr "按增值税现金收付制确认的年度交易金额。"

msgctxt "help:aeat.347.report.party,cash_vat_operation:"
msgid ""
"Only for cash basis operations. Set to identify cash basis operations aside "
"from the rest."
msgstr "仅适用于现金收付制交易。设置后，将现金收付制交易与其他交易区分。"

msgctxt "help:aeat.347.report.party,community_vat:"
msgid ""
"VAT number for professionals established in other state member without "
"national VAT"
msgstr "在其他成员国注册且没有本国增值税号的专业人士的增值税号"

msgctxt "help:aeat.347.report.party,insurance:"
msgid ""
"Only for insurance companies. Set to identify insurance operations aside "
"from the rest."
msgstr "仅适用于保险公司。设置后，将保险交易与其他交易区分。"

msgctxt "help:aeat.347.report.party,related_goods_operation:"
msgid ""
"Only for related goods operations. Set to identify related goods operations "
"aside from the rest."
msgstr "仅适用于相关货物交易。设置后，将相关货物交易与其他交易区分。"

msgctxt "help:aeat.347.report.party,representative_vat:"
msgid "Legal Representative VAT number"
msgstr "法定代表人增值税号"

msgctxt "help:aeat.347.report.party,tax_person_operation:"
msgid ""
"Only for taxable person operations. Set to identify taxable person "
"operations aside from the rest."
msgstr "仅适用于反向征税交易。设置后，将反向征税交易与其他交易区分。"

